{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the in-between\u2026</strong><br>You awaken in a realm caught between life and death \u2014 a patchwork of forgotten places stitched together by shadows and whispers. Wander the echoing halls of an abandoned hospital, sift through the rusted remains of an old factory, drift through the hollow corridors of a long-forgotten space station, and descend into a dungeon stained by unspeakable acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, nothing is quite alive\u2026 but nothing is truly dead. Friendly chills meet unsettling mysteries as you explore, collect soul gems, and uncover the hidden threads tying these worlds together. The scares may be gentle, but the atmosphere will linger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you find your way back to the living, or become just another echo in the dark?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947150?t=1756909973","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947150/ea25afc1a39fea4e736d64f098530a54f81810d7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756909973","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947150/08d69022781313882e318e71e760a8074b6291b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756909973","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947150/08d69022781313882e318e71e760a8074b6291b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756909973","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Some scenes contain a lot of blood and, mutilated body's."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_para